* Series R-L model for the IHP SG13G2 spiral inductors (inductor2).
*
* Not part of the IHP PDK, which ships no compact inductor model. Written for
* this package; it matches ihp.models.sax.inductors.inductor_with_loss:
* Z = resistance + j*omega*inductance. Set ``resistance`` to the series
* resistance at the operating frequency (2*pi*f*L/Q) for RF work.

.subckt ihp_inductor_rl p1 p2 inductance=33.303e-12 resistance=0.5777
L1 p1 n1 {inductance}
R1 n1 p2 {resistance}
.ends ihp_inductor_rl
